# Optional: used for canonical URLs, sitemap and Open Graph tags.
# Defaults to https://shawon-analyst-portfolio.vercel.app when unset.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://shawon-analyst-portfolio.vercel.app

# Optional: set to a GitHub personal access token to raise the REST API rate
# limit for the live repository feed on /work (60 -> 5000 requests/hour).
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional: contact form delivery. Create a form at https://formspree.io, then
# copy the ID out of its endpoint (https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX -> XXXXXXXX).
# Submissions are POSTed straight to it and land in the account's inbox. While
# this is unset, the inquiry form hands the message to the visitor's mail client
# instead, so no message is ever dropped.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined at build time: after changing this, restart
# `npm run dev`, or redeploy on Vercel. You can also skip this file entirely and
# paste the ID into FORMSPREE_FORM_ID_IN_CODE in components/ContactForm.tsx.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
